## Resource Finding Complete

I have successfully completed the resource finding phase for the research project **"The Review Death Spiral: Equilibrium Modeling of Peer Review under AI-Driven Scale"**.

### Summary of Created Files

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `literature_review.md` | Comprehensive review of 6 key papers on peer review equilibrium modeling |
| `resources.md` | Complete catalog of papers, datasets, and code repositories |
